  "body_html": "<p>Step up to the plate with this cozy and custom baseball throw blanket from Jeminise, designed especially for baseball players and fans. This personalized blanket is a thoughtful gift, perfect for celebrating your loved ones with a unique touch of their favorite sport.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with the name and number of your favorite baseball player to create a unique and cherished gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) to suit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfortable Material:</strong> Crafted from Sherpa &amp; Fleece Fabric, featuring two layers of Polyester along with long-lasting color ink, ensuring a super soft, lightweight, and comfortable feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal gift for men and women, moms and dads, perfect for Valentine's, Mother's and Father's Day, Christmas Day, or New Year's.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat to maintain softness and fluffiness.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Baseball Design 02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), X-Large (80x60 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat. Better to wash in a mesh laundry bag.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
